{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>藝人朱慧敏昨日在天氣轉冷之際突然發佈一家四口落水游泳片段，其零贅肉泳裝造型與幼童無懼低溫畫面瞬間嚇窒大批粉絲。 …</p><p></p>\n<p>藝人朱慧敏昨日在天氣轉冷之際突然發佈一家四口落水游泳片段，其零贅肉泳裝造型與幼童無懼低溫畫面瞬間嚇窒大批粉絲。這段反常規影片在網上引發巨大爭議，背後卻隱藏一段令人意想不到家庭內情。</p>\n<h2>朱慧敏低溫晒游水片展現纖腰長腿</h2>\n<p>近日氣溫顯著下降，朱慧敏卻在社交媒體上載一段一家四口在泳池嬉水影片。畫面中可見她穿上泳裝展現出纖腰長腿零贅肉狀態，完全不似兩孩之母，身材保養極佳。除了完美體態驚艷全網外，更惹人注目是其3歲大女及1歲半細仔同樣浸在水中。片段中醫生老公抱住囝囝，兩父子猶如餅印般神似，一家人對著鏡頭展露燦爛笑容，似乎完全未受近日寒冷天氣影響，畫面隨即引起大眾高度關注。</p>\n<h2>朱慧敏親自拆解寒冬落水驚人真相</h2>\n<p>面對外界對小孩在低溫下游泳感到極度驚訝，朱慧敏迅速透過社交平台發文澄清，親自拆解這場寒冬落水事件實情。她向大眾解釋：「哈哈，開玩笑的！這段片段其實是8月拍的，一直留著自己重看，現在才公開。」原來這段引發熱議片段早於炎夏拍攝，只是她選擇在11月天氣轉冷時發布並幽默留言：「天寒地凍，當然是去游泳了！」結果成功引起網上巨大迴響，證實兩名年幼子女並非真正在寒風中下水。</p>\n<h2>醫生老公餅印囝囝曝光揭孕期運動史</h2>\n<p>朱慧敏與醫生老公婚後火速三年抱兩，她順勢分享兩名子女熱愛水上活動背後原因。她透露懷著大女時，從懷孕6個月起幾乎每天都會去游泳，整個孕期完全沒有出現腰背痛或水腫情況。到懷著細仔時，大女當時只有8個月大，她依然保持極高活動量，經常陪同女兒四處爬行及參與playgroup。她坦言：「不知道是不是這些原因，兩個小孩都喜歡游泳呢！」她將一對子女熱愛游泳歸功於孕期及產後保持龐大活動量。</p>\n<h2>網民熱議星二代活潑可愛水上表現</h2>\n<p>影片曝光後隨即在各大社交平台掀起熱烈討論，大批網民對這場季節錯亂風波感到哭笑不得。不少粉絲留言表示：「嚇死我以為真係咁凍去游水」、「原來係夏天拍落難怪小朋友玩得咁開心」。同時有大量網民將焦點放在朱慧敏極佳體態上，紛紛讚嘆：「生完兩個身材仲係咁fit真係好犀利」、「完全唔似兩孩之母」。亦有網民被一對精靈活潑星二代融化，留言大讚兩姊弟在水中表現淡定。</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179558173234218481_18419881306b066724c5305.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179558173234218481_18419881306b066724c5305.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：朱慧敏IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179558173336234849_9104849096b066725c9cf8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179558173336234849_9104849096b066725c9cf8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：朱慧敏IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/175999347079140541_89968653868e75e7f117dc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"朱慧敏 港姐 04年只得23歲的朱慧敏樣靚身材正，但加入無綫後一直做閒角，少有擔正機會。（圖片來源：東方新地）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/175999347079140541_89968653868e75e7f117dc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>04年只得23歲的朱慧敏樣靚身材正，但加入無綫後一直做閒角，少有擔正機會。（圖片來源：東方新地）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/33239ff4-1b7d-4b46-9180-4203e009039d_19004322682ef028c1b78.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"朱慧敏 港姐 （圖片來源：朱慧敏IG）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/33239ff4-1b7d-4b46-9180-4203e009039d_19004322682ef028c1b78.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：朱慧敏IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179558173439122983_15076709476b066726c6723.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-3\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179558173439122983_15076709476b066726c6723.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：朱慧敏IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/145669528_2482405585389325_5226798233691269280_n_65663782967fcc2d647be6-1024x1537.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"朱慧敏 港姐 至於婆媳關係更不用擔心，「奶奶很前衛，很開放，她看到我穿三點式泳衣拍戲，還會誇我身材好！」（圖片來源：Queenie Chu 朱慧敏@Facebook）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/145669528_2482405585389325_5226798233691269280_n_65663782967fcc2d647be6-1024x1537.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>至於婆媳關係更不用擔心，「奶奶很前衛，很開放，她看到我穿三點式泳衣拍戲，還會誇我身材好！」（圖片來源：Queenie Chu 朱慧敏@Facebook）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%98%9f%e4%ba%8c%e4%bb%a3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">星二代</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9c%b1%e6%85%a7%e6%95%8f/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">朱慧敏</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%b8%b8%e6%b0%b4/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">游水</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3549705\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 25 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T06:04:02.522852+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1422,"images":6,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T04:42:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T06:17:26.403568+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T05:57:28.682127+00:00","content_hash":"58dd1ee5fbe612e6eecc6c13334300227771bf081493c182848cba0ddad3c3ad","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}